      "mentions": 45,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and welcoming veterinary surgery"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers across Penge and southeast London speak warmly of Dr Rami, Vanessa, Val, and the wider practice team. Pet owners highlight their kind bedside manner, attentive communication, and patient explanations during examinations, noting that staff consistently make clients feel valued and supported."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and compassionate pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently point out how gently veterinary surgeons and nurses treat anxious cats, bouncy puppies, and senior dogs. Reviewers appreciate that practitioners often crouch down to greet animals at their own level, offering treats and reassurance to ensure clinical checks remain calm and stress-free."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fair regular rates with billing disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Long-standing clients note that the surgery provides good value for consultations without pushing unnecessary products or inflated services. Conversely, two reviewers reported unexpected charges and disputed medication costs, citing surprise over separate fees for eye drops and preventive injections."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the surgery accommodate urgent appointments at short notice?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note that the team has fitted in unwell pets on short notice, accommodating urgent medical concerns on the same day."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the clinic support nervous or anxious animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet owners remark that staff use calm techniques, offering treats and examining pets gently on the floor to reduce anxiety during consultations."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What routine clinical services are available on site?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The practice provides routine companion animal vaccinations, microchipping, wellness check-ups, dental care, and soft tissue surgeries."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where does the clinic direct out-of-hours emergency cases?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Outside regular clinic opening hours, emergency cases are redirected to local partner veterinary hospital facilities in the area."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
